9px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Journey of IPFQ<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-5297fda elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5297fda\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-6164345\" data-id=\"6164345\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ce87f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8ce87f7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A few years ago, a group of visionary physiotherapists from India working in Qatar were planning to form an organization to represent them professionally. This dream became a reality in 2011 when 65 physiotherapists unanimously selected the first team of office bearers of the forum.<\/p><p>The founding members worked hard to get a foothold among other sister concerns and bring forward the role of physiotherapists in the health sector. A lot of effort by many of them gave us the legal viability to be established as a forum and the By-Law was drafted. These, along with a formal request were submitted to the president of Indian Cultural Center(ICC) in February 2013. While waiting to be recognized by the Embassy of India and affiliation with ICC, the forum was active by joining hands with other organizations and health authorities to participate in various health camps.<\/p><p>In May 2013, the first group of office bearers completed their tenure and a new panel was selected to represent the forum. They dutifully took forward the good work that was started towards affiliation with ICC. The hard work paid off and with the support of His Excellency the Ambassador of India to Qatar, on June 17th 2013, we received affiliation with Indian Cultural Center under the aegis of Embassy of India.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-7d6a766\" data-id=\"7d6a766\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa357d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"aa357d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.13.3 - 28-05-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"598\" src=\"https:\/\/ipfq.qa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/about-05.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5958\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-07e73d9 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"07e73d9\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f3d0b2b\" data-id=\"f3d0b2b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-03c5b94 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"03c5b94\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-0a0c8a0\" data-id=\"0a0c8a0\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1852289 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1852289\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>With this newfound recognition, the members of IPFQ got a boost to their morale to carry forward the goodwill and social responsibilities. IPFQ was inaugurated on 1st November 2013 at the Copthorne Hotel, Doha. The inaugural event was graced by dignitaries from Indian Embassy in Qatar, Heads of Physiotherapy from Government and Private hospitals in Qatar and well-wishers from various healthcare organizations. <br \/><br \/>From its conceptualization, IPFQ has been active in promoting physiotherapy among the public in Qatar through participation in medical camps, awareness activities, and joining hands with other organizations in community outreach initiatives.<br \/>In August 2018, IPFQ became an associated organization of Indian Business and Professional Council (IBPC) as per the directives of Indian Embassy thereby cementing its presence among the professional organizations in Qatar. As a new associate organization, IPFQ adopted a new constitution as per the guidelines of IBPC.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-034eac8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"034eac8\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-453b3b4\" data-id=\"453b3b4\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d29621f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d29621f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"https:\/\/ipfq.qa\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/abt03.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5757\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-dc7db94\" data-id=\"dc7db94\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e3840ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e3840ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>IPFQ has strived to fulfill its vision of uplifting the physiotherapy practice in Qatar through various professional activities. Through the years IPFQ has brought to Qatar, renowned international faculties to enrich the skill set of physiotherapists. IPFQ has also provided a platform to its members to showcase their professional advancements in professional gatherings organized by the forum.. <br \/><br \/>Over the past many years IPFQ has gained credibility and trust in the community through its hard work and dedication. IPFQ become an indispensable part of most of the community outreach programs organized by the health authorities and various non-profit organizations in Qatar. These selfless services has made IPFQ a valued associate member of Indian Embassy in Qatar.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>About Us Inspire excellence in physiotherapy World physiotherapy(R) describes physiotherapy as \u201cA healthcare profession that provides services to develop, maintain and restore people\u2019s maximum movement and functional ability\u201d. Physiotherapists are movement specialists who work towards health and wellbeing of people from all walks of life through promotion, prevention, treatment\/intervention and rehabilitation. Indian Physiotherapy Forum Qatar [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2580","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ipfq.qa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2580","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ipfq.qa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ipfq.qa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ipfq.qa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/us